#
# File: 250-ARP-Flux-reply-out-monitor.rule
# Policy: Monitor outbound ARP replies using the expected local IP/MAC pair
# Description:
#     Runs after ARP hook and zone interface map/vmap dispatch; no interface matching here.
#     For true ARP-flux control, configure per-interface ownership and kernel ARP settings.
#     Direction: local-to-remote; intended for arp output hook.
#
arp operation reply arp saddr ip $ZONE_INTF_ADDR arp saddr ether $ZONE_INTF_MACADDR counter comment "local-to-remote Local address reply monitor"
